    "copy": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Improvised psych-rock meets cosmic storytelling."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Rational music falling into the future."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Liquid Rigidity Project are a collective currently based in southern Taiwan."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Never Lost A Limb I Needed"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "This album documents a live, fluid, partly rigid, improvised session that was recorded at Red Dragon Records, Tainan City, Taiwan, on June 18th, 2026."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "None of these songs are to be taken as definitive versions. Each performance mutates the song's structure and arrangement. They change according to our whims, the temperature, and heavily dependent on the quantity (and flavour) of the potato chips (crisps)."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Credits"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Released June 27, 2026"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Performed by Liquid Rigidity Project"
      },
