  {
    "name": "Mirko Liang",
    "affiliation": "Studio Affiliate",
    "genre": "Punk Rock • Surf Punk • Classical",
    "city": "Taiwan",
    "bio": "Italy born, Australia relocated, Taiwan based, Mirko Liang is a punk-rock musician and songwriter. Trained classically, he then turned electric and played in several bands mostly punk-rock and surf-punk. His swashbuckling solo project (since 2021) is an amalgam of intense strumming bringing glimpses of classical baroque music and flamenco to punk-rock. The lyrics convey philosophical themes - such as existentialism and absurdism - while mostly drawing from European baroque culture and horror fiction. His debut solo album Art Of The Wheel (Red Dragon Records, 2024) features the back up vocals of Andrew Jackson (former Good Riddance).",
